    "summary": "`good-avatar-menu` is the account control in the topbar. The round trigger opens an approximately 250 × 384 px panel with an identity header, profile links, expandable account and language rows, a Dark Mode switch, and an optional sign-out action. The 40 px rows and their spacing belong to the component. It uses the same semantic colors in light and dark themes.",
